m/profile_images/1991928893305995264/BBKxw-J5_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Paula Lewis", "username": "PaulaLe35307050"}, "content": "", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 0}}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0DON'T TREAD ON ME\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCIif6tG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 21, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8781262, "raw_content": ">The framers of the Constitution chose to create a constitutional republic instead of a direct democracy, fearing that a pure democracy could lead to \"mob rule\" or the tyranny of the majority. However, the document sets up a system of representative government derived from the people.\n\n>The Preamble: Begins with \"We the People,\" establishing that the power of the government comes from its citizens rather than a king or a ruler\n\n>Article IV, Section 4: Specifically guarantees to every state in the Union a \"Re-public-an Form of Government,\" ensuring that power remains with the public and their elected officials rather than a monarchy.\n\nBuy yet democrats keep  saying we are destroying our countries democracy, They are fucking correct, I want their democracy burned down, we are a fucking REPUBLIC", "author": "mikethemarine", "created": 1786765680815, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "where does it talk about democracy in the u.s. constitution?", "last_comment_created": 1786765680815, "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>The framers of the Constitution chose to create a constitutional republic instead of a direct democracy, fearing that a pure democracy could lead to &quot;mob rule&quot; or the tyranny of the majority. However, the document sets up a system of representative government derived from the people.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Preamble: Begins with &quot;We the People,&quot; establishing that the power of the government comes from its citizens rather than a king or a ruler</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Article IV, Section 4: Specifically guarantees to every state in the Union a &quot;Re-public-an Form of Government,&quot; ensuring that power remains with the public and their elected officials rather than a monarchy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Buy yet democrats keep  saying we are destroying our countries democracy, They are fucking correct, I want their democracy burned down, we are a fucking REPUBLIC</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 21, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2088408087120257366", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCIif6gw", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 22, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8781236, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1786764616045, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Pickinpox", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCIif6gw.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/KimKatieUSA/status/2088408087120257366?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution":